  "question": {
    "text": "<p>In a triangle&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></math>, if <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>&nbsp;and the lengths of the sides opposite to the angles&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>&nbsp;and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> are <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn></math> respectively, then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>C</mi></math>&nbsp;is equal to</p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "7EYCD",
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>9</mn><mn>7</mn></mfrac></math>",
